4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure this park doesn't merely look lovely on paper, I suggest we examine the actual longevity of our city's previous projects.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We should also consider the practicalities of the construction phase. I am concerned about whether the proposed timelines are realistic given the local contractor landscape.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited! But we have to be careful about the money, right? I want to know how much it actually costs to keep the park pretty after it's finished!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must be realistic about the human cost. A beautiful design is useless if there is no one available to maintain it daily. I want to know who is actually doing the work.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with the need for realism. We must ensure the plan respects the physical behavior of the land and the actual movement of the people who use it.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, a very prudent point. If we ignore the patterns of usage and the quality of past execution, we are simply designing a future ruin.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"Exactly. If the ground conditions are unpredictable or the firms are overstretched, the project will drift. We need data on the firms and the site's history.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that's a great point! If we don't have enough people to help, the costs will just go up and up. We need to see the budget for upkeep!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Precisely. I am interested in the balance between professional staff and external services. We cannot assume the city has an infinite supply of labor.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look into the drainage and the crossing counts. A park is a living system; it must handle the rain and the crowds without failing.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall focus on the condition of previous works. It is often more illuminating to see where the paint is peeling than to read a brochure.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will investigate the regional firms and the depot phasing. I want to see if the hoarding and the earth-moving schedules are actually feasible.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm going to check the upkeep ledger and the habitat fund! I want to make sure we aren't just spending money we don't have in three years!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I need to know if the current staffing levels can support a new addition to the rota.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I believe we have a comprehensive plan. We are covering the financial, the structural, the human, and the environmental aspects of the site.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. A balanced approach is the only way to avoid the ""handsome opening"" syndrome. I look forward to seeing what the records reveal.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. Let us proceed with the investigations.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mio,,Yay! Let's find out the truth about the money!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I hope the data is honest. I suspect the labor shortage is more severe than the administration admits.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let us gather the facts first. I will see how the ground and the people actually behave.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,1,,action,Benjamin,,Condition of works from the earlier programme; Record of the eastern avenue planting,"{""action"":""investigate"",""cards"":[""card_06"",""card_05""],""parse"":""ok""}"
